                                            the 2019 Plan. A total of 657,895 shares were initially reserved under the 2021 Plan, which
                                            total is subject to increase on January 1st of each year from 2022 to 2031 by the lesser
                                            of (i) 4 percent of the number of shares of stock outstanding as of the close of business
                                            on the immediately preceding December 31st and (ii) the number of shares of stock determined
                                            by the Board on or prior to such date for such year.</TD>
